[[7028,2707,"The care management and treatment of this child on the innumerable occasions she presented with an exacerbation of asthma, was centred solely on treating the immediate presentation as an isolated acute event seeking its stabilisation and returning her to the care of her family.","lack of long term management of asthma",""],[7029,2707,"No co-ordinating record of these occasions","lack of coordinated record keeping",""],[7030,2707,"No analysis of the frequency or circumstances of the events","lack of event frequency analysis",""],[7031,2707,"No analysis of the medication or level of medication prescribed","lack of medication level analysis",""],[7032,2707,"No determination of its effectiveness the frequency or regularity of its use","lack of effectiveness determination",""],[7033,2707,"No appreciation of the deteriorating nature of her respiratory condition","lack of deterioration appreciation",""]]